(178, 'CentralDB(14).xlsx', 'CID-ANOV-B8076', 'ANOVOCARE', 'CLOTHES + MOP', 'Wednesday', 'Thursday', '612', '#e561dc', 'Route 612', '09:20-09:30', '2M', 23, '0', 12, 'STANDARD POCKET MOPS; CLEANING CLOTHS', 'Close all bags using cable ties before washing. After drying, place the bags on the trolley, cut the cable ties, weigh everything together, and then give the net bags to the production team.', 'Close all net bags using cable ties before washing, ensuring that cleaning cloths are kept separate from mops in different net bags. After drying, remove the cable ties, weigh the mops together and the cleaning cloths separately, then check whether the trolley is ready. If it is, place the net bags inside the trolley; if not, hand them over to the production team.', null, 2, null),
